OL,3,GNEWSARare glimpse inside 'hidden
OL,4,AHogwarts' manor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19th Century manor, described by
OL,7,Fthose who work there as Lincolnshire's
OL,8,F"hidden version of Hogwarts", will open
OL,9,Fits doors to visitors for two days.
OL,11,FThe Grade I listed Harlaxton Manor,
OL,12,Fnear Grantham, will host The Summer
OL,13,FOpen House on Sunday 30 and Monday 31
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FThe building is home to Harlaxton
OL,17,FCollege, which is the British campus of
OL,18,Fthe University of Evansville in the
OL,19,FUnited States, and is rarely open to
OL,20,Fthe public.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
