OL,3,GNEWSARare glimpse inside 'hidden
OL,4,AHogwarts' manor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBethan Watson, events manager, said:
OL,7,F"It is always a pleasure to share this
OL,8,Fremarkable estate with the public and
OL,9,Fgive people the opportunity to
OL,10,Fexperience the history, architecture
OL,11,Fand beautiful surroundings that make
OL,12,Fthe manor so incredibly special."
